        <mxCell id="33" value="✓ All nodes share one centralized database&lt;br&gt;✓ Rows scoped by compute_node_id — each node reads only its own rows&lt;br&gt;✓ FK constraints enforced ON DELETE CASCADE (remote mode only)&lt;br&gt;✓ Stale node detection via last_seen timeout — auto-marks inactive&lt;br&gt;✓ UPSERT on startup — register_compute_node() is idempotent&lt;br&gt;✓ image table uses sentinel compute_node_id=&apos;GLOBAL&apos; (shared images)&lt;br&gt;✓ Concurrent Alembic migrations serialised via _MIGRATION_LOCK"
