        <!-- compute_node_id legend -->
        <mxCell id="62" value="&lt;b&gt;compute_node_id Strategy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Added to ALL 7 data tables as NOT NULL&lt;br&gt;• Forms composite PK with domain key (fcp_id, etc.)&lt;br&gt;• Local mode: stored but NOT used in query filtering&lt;br&gt;• Remote mode: FK enforced + _node_filter() on reads&lt;br&gt;• image table: DEFAULT &apos;GLOBAL&apos; (shared images)&lt;br&gt;• ON DELETE CASCADE from compute_nodes (remote only)&lt;br&gt;• Two nodes can hold same fcp_id — PK is composite"
          style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontColor=#37474F;"
